# platform.pico.usb.host

The Pico SDK platform's USB host implementation of mm.usb.host over TinyUSB.
Active on boards that provide a PIO USB host port (pico_usb_host, pico2_usb_host)
for non-storage peripherals alongside the mm.mcu storage stack.
